WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:08.340
I applied to the city in early 2014
to turn my coin-operated laundry into housing.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.200
We sit at ground zero of anti-gentrification
in San Francisco.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.400
No monsters in the Mission!

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.789
Getting this property approved has so far
taken

00:00:19.789 --> 00:00:22.820
longer than it took the United States to win
World War 2.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.800
I’ve spent $1.2 million.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:25.980
Whose city?

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.060
Our city!

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.020
The Board of Supervisors denied the project

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:35.000
because it cast a partial shadow on an adjacent schoolyard.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:41.500
If you’re wondering why housing in San Francisco
is expensive,

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.790
they make it expensive here.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:44.920
It is intentional.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.700
Sky-high rents in San Francisco...

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.620
They pay $7000 a month...

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.500
...a 54% rent increase

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.000
It’s just been such a steady climb...

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.980
...dramatically in the last 5 to 10 years

00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:57.700
It’s astounding...

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.080
A sky-high new record...

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.500
A once working class neighborhood transformed...

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:06.780
San Francisco has become the most expensive city to live in

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:07.840
in the nation.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.080
As its population has boomed over the past few decades,

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:15.080
developers have found it almost impossible to build new housing.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.820
The story of one small developer, in particular,

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.280
shines a light on what’s gone wrong in 
the Golden Gate City.

00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:26.260
San Francisco is the worst place in the country to try to do development,

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.980
and the Mission is the worst place in San Francisco.

